  "description": "While working in the mountains as usual, woodcutter Choi Nam-Wook stops by a stream, only to lose a very...personal possession in the water. As he laments his misfortune, a dense mist rolls in and a mysterious Mountain God appears, offering to retrieve what was lost…for a price.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Jeollaeyahandonghwa (전래야한동화) Collection.*",
